         rest to him who is weary; and this is the refreshing: yet they would not hear.

Therefore hear the word of Yahweh, you

          {+}
         scoffers, that rule this people who is in Jerusalem:

Because you

          {+}
         have said, We have made a covenant with death, and we are at agreement with Sheol; when the overflowing scourge will pass through, it will not come to us; for we have made lies our refuge, and under falsehood we have hid ourselves:

And your

          {+}
         covenant with death will be annulled, and your

          {+}
         agreement with Sheol will not stand; when the overflowing scourge will pass through, then you

          {+}
         will be trodden down by it.

As often as it passes through, it will take you

          {+}
        ; for morning by morning it will pass through, by day and by night: and it will be nothing but terror to understand the message.

Now therefore don't be

          {+}
         scoffers, or else your

          {+}
         bonds will be made strong; for a decree of destruction I have heard from the Lord, Yahweh of hosts, on the whole earth.

Give

          {+}
         ear, and hear my voice; listen, and hear my speech.
